inch</ENG> acrylic in two layers with smooth edge conforming to <RID>ANSI Z97.1</RID>] [decorative laminate face with applied 
[tactile] graphics, sign is fabricated of a balanced core sandwiched between<MET> 0.89 mm</MET><ENG> 0.035 inch</ENG> standard grade 
high pressure laminated faces].  Provide signs that can accept [images] [raised copy and Braille with printable 
